  "content": {
    "title": "When does Justin Bieber perform at Coachella? How to watch livestream.",
    "text": "April 11, 2026Updated April 12, 2026, 12:47 p.m. ETPark your \"Yukon\" right here because Justin Bieber is headlining this year's Coachella for the first time.In other words, \"Bieber Fever\" will be in the air at the popular music festival in Indio, California, this weekend. The fandom has been showing off their outfit prep on social media in anticipation of his set.His upcoming appearance follows his emotional, stripped-down performance at the 2026 Grammys and lengthy hiatus.Here's how to watch Justin Bieber's Coachella performance.When is Coachella 2026?The festival is two weekends: April 10-12 and April 17-19.When is Justin Bieber headlining at Coachella 2026?Festivalgoers can expect Bieber to headline on both April 11 and April 18.When does Justin Bieber perform at Coachella 2026 Weekend 1?Bieber will perform on the Coachella stage on April 11 at 11:25 p.m. PDT. His set will be streaming on YouTube during that time slot.Fans can watch Coachella performances on the video platform on April 10, beginning at 4 p.m. PT/ 7 p.m. ET. Through the YouTube app on your TV, you can stream multiple stages simultaneously from your couch.Coachella 2026 Weekend 1 set timesA complete list of day-by-day set times can be found on Coachella's website or in an Instagram post below:Taylor Ardrey is a news reporter for USA TODAY. You can reach her at tardrey@usatodayco.com.",
